{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-22410","model_call":51,"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"do employers take\" \"online degrees\" seriously)"},"record":{"query":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"do employers take\" \"online degrees\" seriously)"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_05_1620316034#4_3099638358","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2724","rank":1,"snippet":"online and traditional classes? Online classes vs traditional classes \" , \"segment\": \"Labs, classes, teachers, libraries, office workers, toilets etc are some of the very minimum requirements in traditional classroom systems. Since the requirements to set up online classes are so less therefore the expenses too are the least. In traditional classroom programs, the infrastructure set up will cost a huge amount of money. Maintenance of the infrastructure as well as other related costs are recurring costs unlike in online classroom programs where the establishment costs are all one time investments. On line classes can be attended by all irrespective of their age and occupation. Since traditional classes follow strict rules so students are grouped age wise for a particular curricula. Moreover these classes require regular attendance unlike on line classes. « Older Posts<cover>Do employers take online degrees seriously? »</cover>\" , \"start_char\": 2088.000000 , \"title\": \"What is the difference between online and traditional classes? « Education Frequently Asked Questions\" , \"url\": \"http://www.educationcenters.com/faq/online-education/what-is-the-difference-between-online-and-traditional-classes-1232.php\" }"},"time":206},"model_calls":51,"document_judgments":46,"relevance_3":29,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
